-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 30.12.1997: the amendment of §18(א) of the colleges'
-- promotion-ranks agreement of 22.5.1997
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/1997-05-22_histadrut-hamorim_michlalot-promotion-ranks.l4),
-- between the State and הסתדרות המורים. It takes the colleges' directors'
-- representative out of the accompanying committee's members and seats him
-- as an observer only, and declares this a clarification of what the
-- parties meant when they signed. It encodes what it changes and imports
-- the rest. It speaks to no pay item and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `1997-05-22_histadrut-hamorim_michlalot-promotion-ranks`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 30.12.1997 — תיקון סעיף 18(א) להסכם דרגות הקידום במכללות`

-- akn:preamble/p1 The Registrar's file number (980049); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner and the director-general ("the employers"), and הסתדרות המורים; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 A recital: the agreement of 22 May 1997 on the colleges' promotion ranks ("the agreement"; the corpus's sic for its name).
-- akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 Recitals: the parties would amend its §18(א), and agree the amendment is a clarification only.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The words of agreement; no rule.
-- akn:art_1 The preamble is part of the agreement; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 The signing formula and the signatures; no rule.

-- ¶2: made in Jerusalem and signed on 30/12/97.
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the amendment of 22.5.1997 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 12 1997

-- §2: in §18(א) the words "נציג מנהלי המכללות" are struck from the
-- members, and at its end: "the colleges' directors' representative sits
-- in the accompanying committee as an observer only". §3: the parties
-- declare the amendment is what they meant when they signed; so it is
-- read from 22.5.1997, not from its own day.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_3
`the accompanying committee's members as amended on 30.12.1997` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN m YIELD NOT m EQUALS `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997`)
           `the accompanying committee's members as signed, of 22.5.1997`

GIVEN m IS A `member of the accompanying committee of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an observer only in the accompanying committee, from 22.5.1997` m IF
    m EQUALS `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997`

`the amendment of 30.12.1997 speaks from` MEANS `the colleges' promotion-ranks agreement was signed on`

#ASSERT count `the accompanying committee's members as amended on 30.12.1997` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT NOT elem `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997` `the accompanying committee's members as amended on 30.12.1997`
#ASSERT `an observer only in the accompanying committee, from 22.5.1997` `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997`
#ASSERT `the amendment of 30.12.1997 speaks from` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 5 1997
